      "id": "dialogue.mystic_cave.whim_arrival",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "title": "A Voice in the Cave",
      "body": "A calm voice greets you from the cave's shifting light. It calls itself the Whim and says you are a goblin with a chance to choose what comes next.",
      "choices": [{"id": "listen", "label": "Listen to the Whim", "response": "The Whim tells you that goblins are born from possibility, then invites you to make something of it.", "required_codex_ids": [], "event_id": "event.mystic_cave.whim_arrival"}]
    },
    {
      "id": "dialogue.mystic_cave.wrong_machine",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "title": "A Machine with a Name",
      "body": "The Whim conjures a fleeting image and names what it shows: the Wrong Machine. It can rebuild goblins from Raw Chaos. Knowing its name does not give you the machine or a way to use it yet.",
      "choices": [{"id": "remember", "label": "Remember the machine", "response": "You remember its name and purpose. The Whim makes no promise that you can use it yet.", "required_codex_ids": ["codex.mystic_cave.whim_arrival"], "event_id": "event.mystic_cave.wrong_machine"}]
    },
